# ChatAI Client

This is the frontend client for **ChatAI**, a conversational web application built with Vue 3 and Vite. It connects to an AI-powered backend (e.g., a .NET Web API or OpenAI API) and provides an interactive interface similar to ChatGPT.

## 🚀 Tech Stack

- [Vue 3](https://vuejs.org/)
- [Vite](https://vitejs.dev/)
- [Pinia](https://pinia.vuejs.org/) (State Management)
- [Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)
- [TypeScript](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)
- [Axios](https://axios-http.com/) (API calls)

## 📦 Project Setup

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/redouaneT/chat-ai-client.git
cd chat-ai-client

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start the development server
npm run dev
